  "description": "There is a raw purity that makes turning the cranks on a track bike unlike any other cycling experience. The mechanics of a bike distilled to its bare essentials. Our Little Wing frame condenses the best elements of contemporary track frames into a stunning, addictively fast package\n\nPower transfer and tuned handling suited for both the boards and the roads were at the top of our priorities when designing the Little Wing. The frame’s stout stays, oversized head tube, large diameter top and down tubes and integrated seat mast work together to keep all contact points firmly connected and instantly responsive under hard efforts.\n\nFULL GRADE 9 TUBE SET\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEAD TUBES AND HEAD SETS FOR PRECISE HANDLING AND A SEAMLESS LOOK (FULLY INTEGRATED VERSION SHOWN)\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEADSETS COMPLETE WITH ENDURO STAINLESS BEARINGS ARE NOW A STANDARD OFFERING ON ALL FRAMESETS.\n\nTITANIUM SEAT MAST TOPPED WITH OUR BESPOKE 3D SINTERED SEAT MAST TOPPER\n\nCNC MACHINED GRADE 5 TITANIUM DROPOUTS\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT NO. 6 COMPOSITES CARBON FORK INCREASES TIRE CLEARANCE WHILE MAINTAINING PERFORMANCE ORIENTED GEOMETRY\n\nBSA BOTTOM BRACKET FOR MAXIMUM CRANK OPTIONS AND A TIME-TESTED THREADED INTERFACE\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED BRAKE BRIDGE\n\nA FULL ARRAY OF NO. 22 | PROTOTIPO WORKS BESPOKE HARDWARE\n\n3D SINTERED GRADE 5 SEAT MAST TOPPER IN MULTIPLE OFFSETS",
